  {
   "topic": "amounts.floor_rules",
   "text": "Effective floor = min(full overdue sum, max(product base field [flex_base/term_base], ceil-to-cent(25% of full overdue sum))). The API base fields are not the final floor; the DSL has no combined field+percent rule, so floor_rules carry extra keys min_field, combine_with_field='higher', rounding='up_to_cent', cap='full_amount' that the compiler must honour. Do not use the base alone or round to nearest.",
   "doc": "tests/fixtures/external/codex-cedar-limits/01-specification.md"
